    "body": "Thanks for working on this!\r\n\r\nLet's just do a full-scale replacement of all drafts.csswg.org links. I think they're not really worth maintaining any pointers to at this point.\r\n\r\nFor other WHATWG specs, we'll need Bikeshed support or some sort of post-Bikeshed script. (/cc @tabatkins) But for HTML, since for tooling reasons we are cursed with maintaining our own reference database anyway, we might as well take advantage of it and just make the switch.",
